OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly dry with some hazy
OL,6,Fsunshine at times, then cloudier
OL,7,Fthrough the day with some patchy rain,
OL,8,Fthe rain mainly across southern and
OL,9,Fwestern Aberdeenshire. Fresh
OL,10,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA cloudy evening with a few
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain, but mostly dry in
OL,14,Fthe east. Remaining cloudy through the
OL,15,Fnight with a risk of further rain at
OL,16,Ftimes.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FPatchy rain clears away in the
OL,19,Fmorning. The rest of the day will then
OL,20,Fbe dry with good sunny spells between
OL,21,Fpatchy amounts of cloud.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
