OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry,
OL,6,Fbright with variable amounts of cloud
OL,7,Fand some hazy sunny spells. Becoming
OL,8,Fwarm, but fresher at times on the east
OL,9,Fcoast.
